    <string name="direct_navigation_mode_message">Direct navigation hides the on-screen cursor and sends keys from your remote or game controller straight to the web page, so sites that support TV or keyboard focus can highlight links and controls.\n\nTo exit this mode: press Back on your TV remote, or press and hold the B button on a game controller.\n\nThis mode works best with the WebView engine: WebView supports moving focus through the page with the D-pad.</string>
